---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site, commerce } from '../../config/site';
const contact = site.contact.email;
---

<LegalPage title="Terms of sale" updated="October 2026">
  <p>
    These terms apply to orders placed on this website with {site.legalEntity ?? site.fullName} ("HG", "we"). By placing
    an order you agree to them.
  </p>

  <h2>Products and prices</h2>
  <p>
    We describe our fragrances as accurately as we can. Campaign imagery is created with AI and is illustrative. Prices are
    shown in {commerce.currency} and are confirmed on the secure checkout page before you pay. Shipping and any taxes are
    calculated at checkout.
  </p>

  <h2>Orders and payment</h2>
  <p>
    Payment is taken by Stripe at checkout. Your order is accepted when payment succeeds and you see the order confirmation.
    If an item cannot be supplied, we will tell you and refund you in full.
  </p>

  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    We currently ship to the countries offered at checkout. Delivery times are estimates; risk passes to you on delivery.
  </p>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>
    Our returns window and process will be confirmed before launch. Nothing in these terms limits the rights you have under
    the consumer law of the country you live in.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the site</h2>
  <p>
    The site, the HG name and monogram, the films and the imagery belong to HG. Please do not reuse them without
    permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {
      contact ? (
        <>
          Questions about an order: <a class="link" href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a>.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>Contact details will be published here before launch.</>
      )
    }
  </p>
</LegalPage>
